WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:15.199
After the funeral Tom was treated like a hero, and he loved it.

2
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.059
At school he knew everyone was watching him.

3
00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:22.606
The schoolchildren thought Joe and Tom were the greatest heroes in Petersburg, Missouri.

4
00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:27.270
Some even thought they were the greatest heroes in the whole state of Missouri.

5
00:00:27.271 --> 00:00:32.417
Tom had decided that he should be free of Becky because being a hero was better than love.

6
00:00:32.418 --> 00:00:35.156
His eyes, however, often betrayed him.

7
00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:38.940
He pretended not to see her, but his eyes followed her everywhere.

8
00:00:38.941 --> 00:00:43.619
Becky also decided to be free of Tom, but her eyes also betrayed her.

9
00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:50.431
When Becky saw Tom talking to Amy Lawrence, she felt a sharp pang in her heart.

10
00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:56.348
One day she tried to walk away but her feet wouldn't obey, and she found herself standing next to Tom.

11
00:00:56.349 --> 00:01:02.177
She looked at Mary Austin and said, "Mary, why didn't you come to Sunday school yesterday?"

12
00:01:02.178 --> 00:01:05.904
"I did come. Didn't you see me?" she replied.

13
00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:09.893
"Why no," lied Becky. "Where did you sit?"

14
00:01:09.894 --> 00:01:14.995
"I sat where I always sit," answered Mary. "I saw you."

15
00:01:14.996 --> 00:01:20.103
"You did?" said Becky. "Anyway, I wanted to tell you about the picnic."

16
00:01:20.104 --> 00:01:22.545
"What picnic?" asked Mary.

17
00:01:22.546 --> 00:01:26.011
"The one my ma's going to let me have," answered Becky.

18
00:01:26.012 --> 00:01:29.869
"She said I can invite anyone. Do you want to come?"

19
00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:33.641
Mary thought it was a great idea, so she agreed.

20
00:01:33.642 --> 00:01:38.622
Other boys and girls were soon asking to come, and Becky said yes to each one.

21
00:01:38.623 --> 00:01:42.781
The only ones who didn't ask were Tom and Amy.

22
00:01:42.782 --> 00:01:48.052
At lunch Becky waited just outside the schoolhouse in case Tom wanted to say something then.

23
00:01:48.053 --> 00:01:53.328
But to Becky's surprise, Tom didn't ask about the picnic at all.

24
00:01:53.329 --> 00:01:55.630
This made Becky very upset.

25
00:01:55.631 --> 00:02:01.275
She was planning her revenge on Tom when she saw Alfred Temple spilling ink on Tom's spelling book.

26
00:02:01.276 --> 00:02:04.973
Becky was about to tell Tom, but then she changed her mind.

27
00:02:04.974 --> 00:02:09.380
If she didn't tell on Alfred, then Tom would be punished for the spilled ink!

28
00:02:09.381 --> 00:02:12.807
That would serve Tom right for his treatment of Becky!

29
00:02:12.808 --> 00:02:18.850
As Becky went back into the schoolhouse, she noticed that Mr. Dobbins had left a key on his desk.

30
00:02:18.851 --> 00:02:23.027
Mr. Dobbins was a schoolteacher who dreamed of being a doctor.

31
00:02:23.028 --> 00:02:29.628
When the students were busy reading or studying, Mr. Dobbins would open his locked desk and remove a book.

32
00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:35.211
Every child had a theory about what the book contained, but no one had actually seen its contents.

33
00:02:35.212 --> 00:02:39.616
Becky realized that this was her chance to read from the secret book!

34
00:02:39.617 --> 00:02:44.081
Swiftly, she unlocked the drawer and reached for the book.

35
00:02:44.082 --> 00:02:48.689
The title had something to do with anatomy, but that meant nothing to Becky.

36
00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:54.634
So she began to flip through the book, and saw two colorful figures: a man and a woman.

37
00:02:54.635 --> 00:02:58.449
She was startled to find that both figures were completely naked.

38
00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:02.299
Just then a long shadow fell across the teacher's desk.

39
00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:05.562
Somebody was at the door!

40
00:03:05.563 --> 00:03:10.909
In her haste to close the book and put it away, Becky tore a page.

41
00:03:10.910 --> 00:03:14.264
She turned to see who was there—it was Tom!

42
00:03:14.265 --> 00:03:19.552
She shouted at him, "Oh! You're so mean sneaking up on me like that."

43
00:03:19.553 --> 00:03:24.789
"I didn't know you were looking at something," replied Tom.

44
00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.719
"Still, it's your fault I ripped a page.

45
00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.564
Now you're going to tell on me, and I'm going to be whipped.

46
00:03:31.565 --> 00:03:36.292
I've never been whipped at school before," she cried.

47
00:03:36.293 --> 00:03:45.642
Tom wanted to say that he wouldn't tell, but Becky continued, "Be mean if you want, but you're going to be punished too, for spilled ink on your book."

48
00:03:45.643 --> 00:03:49.725
Tom could see that Becky was really afraid.

49
00:03:49.726 --> 00:03:53.245
When the teacher returned, Tom looked over at Becky.

50
00:03:53.246 --> 00:03:56.765
Her face was still full of fear and guilt.

51
00:03:56.766 --> 00:04:01.394
"Girls just can't lie like boys can," thought Tom.

52
00:04:01.395 --> 00:04:04.089
The first lesson after lunch was spelling.

53
00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:08.622
Tom got whipped for the ink that had been spilled in his spelling book.

54
00:04:08.623 --> 00:04:13.684
Tom couldn't remember if he had or hadn't spilled the ink, and he protested loudly.

55
00:04:13.685 --> 00:04:17.745
After the spelling lesson, the teacher told them to read.

56
00:04:17.746 --> 00:04:21.062
Mr. Dobbins took out his own book.

57
00:04:21.063 --> 00:04:26.200
When he opened it, he noticed the tear and shouted, "Who ripped this page?"

58
00:04:26.201 --> 00:04:29.085
The students answered him with silence.

59
00:04:29.086 --> 00:04:33.382
So Mr. Dobbins began asking each student in turn.

60
00:04:33.383 --> 00:04:37.248
Tom noticed that Becky was becoming more and more anxious.

61
00:04:37.249 --> 00:04:40.664
"She's going to confess," thought Tom.

62
00:04:40.665 --> 00:04:48.214
At last the teacher said, "Becky Thatcher, did you tear this page?"

63
00:04:48.215 --> 00:04:51.312
"I did it," blurted out Tom.

64
00:04:51.313 --> 00:04:56.444
Every student was horrified. Tom Sawyer never admitted to anything.

65
00:04:56.445 --> 00:04:58.025
Tom took his whipping.

66
00:04:58.026 --> 00:05:01.622
When he got back to his seat, there was a note from Becky.

67
00:05:01.623 --> 00:05:06.523
"You're so noble," it read.
